{"id":"u-0039238a-1bda-40b5-b692-20d91c573f97","src":"community","title":"The Cut Protocol","author":"","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/glK7s0-the-cut-protocol","desc":"The Cut Protocol is a 12-week, 4-day training program designed to improve your physique while losing body fat without sacrificing muscle or strength. Each session combines focused strength and hypertrophy training with strategically placed cardio, while keeping total workout time around 60–70 minutes.\n\nThe program prioritizes the muscle groups that have the greatest visual impact on physique, including the chest, shoulders, back and arms, while maintaining balanced lower-body development. Compound lifts provide a foundation for continued strength progression, while targeted accessory work builds shape, size and definition.\n\nRather than replacing lifting with excessive cardio, The Cut Protocol uses efficient training, short cardio finishers, daily movement and progressive overload to support a sustainable cut. The goal is simple: finish the 12 weeks leaner, stronger and with a noticeably improved physique.","level":["Beginner","Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":254,"rate":5,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-11-03T10:25:46.148Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Push","Pull","Legs","Upper"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Overhead Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"JM Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Treadmill","sets":[{"sec":600}],"note":"Incline Treadmill Walk\n5-8% Incline\n2.7-3.2 mph"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Mac